### Page 8 of 10

```text
Board of County Commissioners
Minutes of the Proceedings - Final
April 16, 2024
Land Use:Variances/Board App./Plats
22. PUBLIC HEARING regarding approval for a vacation of Lot 1, Block
1, Swan Ranch Rail Park, 12th Filing, located in the NW1/4 of the
NW1/4 of Sect 27 and in the NE1/4 of the NE1/4 of Sect 28, T12N,
R67W, of the 6th PM, Laramie County, WY, and approval of an
administrative plat, Swan Ranch Rail Park, 17th Filing.
24 - 185
Cheyenne Rail HUB, LLC, Board Approval Vacation
and Administrative Plat, Swan Ranch Rail Park, 17th
Filing
Attachments:
Justin Arnold, Planning, said AVI, PC, on behalf of Cheyenne Rail HUB, LLC,
submitted an administrative plat application for Lot 1, Block 1, Swan Ranch Rail Park,
12th Filing, Laramie County, WY. He said the property is located at 5648 Berwick Dr.
Arnold said the application was submitted to move the existing lot line southwesterly
to include the 60-foot access and utility easement within the bounds of the plat and
northerly to include the fenced parcel that is currently outside the bounds of the plat,
through a vacation of the original plat. He noted this action does not create any
additional lots.
Arnold said based on evidence provided, staff recommends approval with the
adoption of findings of fact a and b with one condition.
Chairman Lovett opened the hearing for PUBLIC COMMENT. Hearing no PUBLIC
COMMENT, Chairman Lovett closed the hearing.
A motion was made by Commissioner Holmes, seconded by
Commissioner Thompson, to approve the vacation of Lot 1, Block 1, Swan
Ranch Rail Park, 12th Filing, located in the NW1/4 of the NW1/4 of Sect
27 and the NE1/4 of the NE1/4 of Sect 28, T12N, R67W and approve the
Swan Ranch Rail Park, 17th Filing, administrative plat and adopt the
findings of fact a and b of the staff report and with the following condition:
All agency review comments shall be addressed.
The motion carried by the following vote:
Lovett, Malm, Heath, Holmes, Thompson
Aye:
23. PUBLIC HEARING regarding a site plan for ATR Landscaping,
located at Tract 6, Antelope Hills, 1st Filing, Laramie County, WY.
24 - 195
ATR Landscaping Site Plan
Attachments:
Justin Arnold, Planning, said Suzy Troncin, on behalf of ATR Landscaping, submitted
a site plan application for a previously approved landscaping business on the property
located at Tract 6, Antelope Hills, 1st Filing, Laramie County, WY, and an assigned
address of 6607 Highland Rd, Cheyenne, WY 82009.
