Sonny Keen, Planning, said AVI, PC, on behalf of Karen and Stephen Rice, submitted
an administrative plat application for the property located in Lot 3 and 4, Block 1,
Apple Valley, located at 1319 Green Acres Ct, Cheyenne, WY. The application
request is to vacate lots 3 and 4 in order to form one larger, single parcel, considered
Apple Valley, 2nd Filing, Lot 1.
Keen said based on evidence provided, staff recommends approval with the adoption
of findings of fact a.
